# Python Naming

Follow the Google Python Style Guide for names.

| Type | Public |
|------|--------|
| Modules / files | `lower_with_under.py` |
| Classes | `CapWords` |
| Functions | `lower_with_under` |
| Constants | `CAPS_WITH_UNDER` |

## STOP list

- Dashes in an importable package or a `.py` filename
- Type baked into the name (`events_list`, `metric_dict`)

Distribution names may use dashes (`module-metrics`). Import packages use underscores (`module_metrics`).
